{
  "description": "Mobile 390x844 portrait, DPR 3, touch, R-33 and R-04: what two fingers do over shapes, and which canvas action buttons show once zoomed. Runs last before 16, after 82, with 79's rectangles A and B at y 230 to 320 and nothing selected. Moves two fingers together from A's and B's left strokes 80 px down, reading the scene and app state; then spreads two fingers from 90 px to 170 px apart, saving the ARIA and a capture at that zoom, and pinches them back. It types nothing, uses no clipboard item and follows no link.",
